        "content": "**Not emitted by the running Service.** The Phase 32 telemetry contract reserves these names, but no instrument is created for them in production code (verified Phase 33.3 s2):\n\n- `pathveer.service.enabled`\n- `pathveer.runtime.worker.active`\n- `pathveer.prefix.known_count`\n- `pathveer.routes.inventory_count`\n- `pathveer.dns.cache_record_count`\n- `pathveer.prefix.consecutive_failures`\n\nPanels for these are intentionally **absent** rather than shown as a misleading zero. They will appear once the gauges are instrumented."
