        "content": "**Alerts on this dashboard are evaluated by Prometheus**, not Grafana.\nAlertmanager (local default) routes everything to a no-op receiver; alerts are\nvisible at [Alertmanager UI](http://localhost:9095) and via the Prometheus\n**Alerts** page. Resolve/silence there.\n\n**Runbooks** (repo-relative paths):\n- `PathVeerServiceTelemetryAbsent` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/service-telemetry-absent.md`\n- `PathVeerRuntimeCycleFailureRateHigh` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/runtime-cycle-failures.md`\n- `PathVeerRuntimeCycleFailureRateCritical` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/runtime-cycle-failures.md`\n- `PathVeerRuntimeCycleLatencyHigh` \u2192 `deployment/observability/runbooks/runtime-cycle-latency.md`\n\nAll runbooks: `deployment/observability/runbooks/`"
